1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,380
The second basis applies to permanent tissue: how many kinds of cell does it contain?

2
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:12,786
A simple tissue has only one kind: parenchyma, collenchyma or sclerenchyma.

3
00:00:12,786 --> 00:00:18,450
A complex tissue has several kinds working as a unit: xylem and phloem.

